#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:1
msgid "Tokenomics"
msgstr "Tokenomics"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:3
msgid "DecentralCoin (DCC) has a fixed supply of 100,000,000, minted in full at genesis on 20 July 2021 and never inflated since. Block reward issuance has never activated, so miners earn transaction fees and nothing else. This chapter is the official record of how that supply is allocated, when it unlocks, and what reduces it."
msgstr "DecentralCoin (DCC)لديه إمدادات ثابتة تبلغ 000 100، مطروحة بالكامل عند الجينات في 20 تموز/يوليه 2021 ولم تتضخم أبداً منذ ذلك الحين. لم يتم تفعيل إصدار مكافأة القفل أبداً، لذا فإن عمال المناجم يكسبون أتعاباً و لا شيء آخر. وهذا الفصل هو السجل الرسمي لكيفية تخصيص هذا العرض، عندما يفتح الباب، وما يخفضه."

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The full document, including custody mapping and open risks, is available as a PDF: {download}`DecentralChain DCC Tokenomics v1.0 <../_static/02_decentralchain/downloads/DecentralChain-DCC-Tokenomics.pdf>`. Figures were read from mainnet at height 2,322,348 on 30 August 2026."
msgstr "ويمكن الاطلاع على الوثيقة الكاملة، بما في ذلك رسم خرائط للحضانة والمخاطر المفتوحة، باعتبارها من قوات الدفاع الشعبي: {download}`DecentralChain DCC Tokenomics v1.0 <../_static/02_decentralchain/downloads/DecentralChain-DCC-Tokenomics.pdf>`. وتُقرأ الأرقام من الموقع الشبكي الرئيسي على ارتفاع 348 322 2 في 30 آب/أغسطس 2026."

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:14
msgid "Supply and issuance"
msgstr "الإمداد والإصدار"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:16
msgid "One DCC divides into 100,000,000 dcclets, so every on-chain amount carries eight decimals. Total supply is 100,000,000 DCC, created in block 1 across four genesis transactions. No DCC has been issued since."
msgstr "واحد DCC يقسم إلى 100,000 كتلة، لذا كلّ كمية على سلسلة تحمل ثمانية عشرات. ويبلغ مجموع الإمدادات 000 100 DCC، وهو ما أنشئ في الخانة 1 عبر أربع معاملات من نوع جينسيس. ولم يصدر منذ ذلك الحين أي DCC."

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:20
msgid "That follows from feature 14, *Block Reward and Community Driven Monetary Policy*, never having activated. The mainnet node reports its status as `VOTING`, and `GET /blockchain/rewards` returns error 199. Miners earn transaction fees only, split under NG at 40% to the block including a transaction and 60% to the next block's producer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:25
msgid "The node carries a complete reward implementation should feature 14 ever activate: 6 DCC per block initially, 100,000-block terms, 0.5 DCC vote increments. DecentralChain removed the DAO and buyback recipients that the upstream design pays a share to, so the entire reward would go to the block producer. At 60-second blocks that is 3,153,600 DCC per year, an initial inflation rate of 3.15%."
msgstr ""

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:30
msgid "**DecentralChain commits to leaving feature 14 deactivated. Total supply stays at 100,000,000 DCC permanently.**"
msgstr "**DecentralChain يلتزم بترك الميزة 14 مُعطّلة. ويبقى مجموع الامدادات عند 000 100 DCC بشكل دائم.**"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:33
#, python-format
msgid "Stated plainly: feature activation requires 18,000 votes inside a 20,000-block window, and one address currently produces 100% of blocks, so that operator could activate feature 14 unilaterally. The commitment is a governance promise backed by the custody separation described in the PDF. It is not yet a technical impossibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:38
msgid "Current distribution"
msgstr "التوزيع الحالي"

#: ../../02_decentralchain/11_tokenomics.md:40
#, python-format
msgid "98,091,614 DCC, or 98.09% of supply, sits in six addresses traceable to the four genesis wallets. External float is 1,908,386 DCC, of which roughly 900,000 is held in four identifiable wallets, so genuinely dispersed supply is close to 1,000,000 DCC."
